# Example CODEOWNERS for a copy of this repository managed with GitOps
# (docs/guides/gitops_cloud_build.md). Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS, replace
# the team names, and turn on "Require review from Code Owners" in the
# branch ruleset.
#
# The last matching rule wins, so specific paths come after general ones.

# Default owners for everything.
*                               @your-org/codemender-maintainers

# Infrastructure and the pipeline itself.
/terraform/                     @your-org/platform-team
/cloudbuild/                    @your-org/platform-team @your-org/security-team
/cloudbuild.yaml                @your-org/platform-team
/scripts/ci/                    @your-org/platform-team @your-org/security-team
/.github/                       @your-org/platform-team @your-org/security-team

# What gets scanned and how the deployment is set up. repos.yaml can run code
# in the scan jobs (build_command), so the security team reviews it too.
/terraform/gcp/repos.yaml       @your-org/platform-team @your-org/security-team
/terraform/gcp/deployment.yaml  @your-org/platform-team
